H2("6.4   Layer D on Stored Pages (RQ3)")
P("On 2,004 stored pages, gpt-6-luna called 7.6 % of phishing pages safe [6.1, 9.4] and claude-haiku-5-5 6.0 % [4.7, 7.6]. The 0.99 override lowers these to 5.1 % [3.9, 6.6] and 4.4 % [3.3, 5.8]. Clean pages were called phishing in 2.9 % and 4.8 % of cases. Haiku misses fewer phishing pages (McNemar p = 0.004) but blocks more clean pages (p = 0.005), and the miss difference is not significant once the override applies (p = 0.14). Median and p95 latency were 2.0 and 4.8 s for gpt-6-luna and 1.5 and 3.2 s for Haiku, at $0.000129 and $0.000224 per page.")

